    {
      "id": "c9534404-40f8-4494-bada-7fae75f2c588",
      "name": "AI: Categorize Purchase Requisition",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        736,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an enterprise procurement classification assistant.\n\nAnalyze the following purchase requisition and determine the best procurement category.\n\nPurchase Requisition Details:\n- PR ID: {{$json.pr_id}}\n- Requester: {{$json.requester}}\n- Department: {{$json.department}}\n- Description: {{$json.description}}\n- Amount: {{$json.amount}} {{$json.currency}}\n- Suggested Category: {{$json.suggested_category}}\n\nItems:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.items, null, 2) }}\n\nAllowed Categories:\n- IT Equipment\n- Office Supplies\n- Software\n- Facilities\n- Marketing\n- HR & Training\n- Professional Services\n- Logistics\n- Uncategorized\n\nTasks:\n1. Determine the most appropriate category.\n2. Detect whether the suggested category may be incorrect.\n3. Provide a confidence score between 0 and 100.\n4. Suggest corrected category if needed.\n5. Explain reasoning briefly.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"final_category\": \"\",\n  \"confidence_score\": 0,\n  \"misclassification_risk\": \"\",\n  \"suggested_correction\": \"\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"\"\n}",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
    {
      "id": "26810a53-34be-4298-ad6f-44cd8ef90f34",
      "name": "Parse AI Classification Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1088,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.text;\n\nlet parsed;\n\ntry {\n  parsed = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = {\n    final_category: \"Uncategorized\",\n    confidence_score: 0,\n    misclassification_risk: \"Unknown\",\n    suggested_correction: \"Manual Review Required\",\n    reasoning: \"Unable to parse AI response\"\n  };\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...parsed\n  }\n};"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "8a7c41f1-e49e-43d7-bf4b-40363eb143cf",
      "name": "Calculate Classification Confidence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1296,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\n\nconst confidence = Number(data.confidence_score) || 0;\n\nlet confidence_level;\nlet auto_approve;\nlet review_reason = \"\";\n\nif (confidence >= 85) {\n  confidence_level = \"High\";\n  auto_approve = true;\n} else if (confidence >= 60) {\n  confidence_level = \"Medium\";\n  auto_approve = false;\n  review_reason = \"Moderate AI confidence\";\n} else {\n  confidence_level = \"Low\";\n  auto_approve = false;\n  review_reason = \"Low AI confidence\";\n}\n\n// Additional procurement risk rule\nif (data.misclassification_risk === \"High\") {\n  auto_approve = false;\n  review_reason = \"Potential category mismatch detected\";\n}\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...data,\n    confidence_level,\n    auto_approve,\n    review_reason\n  }\n};"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
