      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -688,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 688,
        "height": 848,
        "content": "# Intelligent Purchase Requisition Categorization\n\n## How it works:\nThis workflow automates procurement request classification using AI. When a new purchase requisition (PR) is submitted through the webhook, the workflow validates and normalizes the incoming data before sending the requisition details to Google Gemini for intelligent category classification. The AI returns the final procurement category, confidence score, misclassification risk, suggested correction, and reasoning. Based on the confidence level and detected risk, the workflow automatically decides whether the PR should be auto-approved or escalated for manual procurement review. Approved and review-required requests are assigned routing statuses, stored in Google Sheets for audit tracking, and distributed through Gmail and Slack notifications so procurement teams stay informed about approvals, escalations, and processing outcomes in real time.\n\n## Setup steps:\n1. Connect Google Gemini API credentials  \n2. Configure Gmail OAuth2 credentials for email notifications  \n3. Connect Slack OAuth2 credentials for procurement alerts  \n4. Connect Google Sheets and create the PR tracking spreadsheet  \n5. Configure the webhook endpoint for PR submissions  \n6. Update email recipients and Slack channel IDs as needed  \n7. Customize procurement categories if required  \n8. Test the workflow with sample PR payloads  \n9. Activate the workflow after validation  "
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
